  "pull_request": {
    "number": 147,
    "title": "test: lint against real soroban-sdk and harden type path resolution",
    "body": "Closes #15\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an integration test that runs the lints end-to-end against the real soroban-sdk crate, and hardens the type-path resolution so it's no longer based on string-suffix matching.\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n\r\nAdded [fixture path, e.g. soroban_cost_lints/tests/fixtures/] — a minimal real Soroban contract crate depending on actual soroban-sdk, containing one example of each lint's anti-pattern plus its clean counterpart.\r\nWired the fixture into cargo test --workspace via dylint's ui_test support, with its own Cargo.toml excluded from the main workspace to avoid lockfile/version conflicts.\r\nReplaced def_path_str-based suffix comparison in soroban_cost_lints/src/lib.rs with clippy_utils::match_def_path, matching on the DefId's actual crate identity plus exact path segments — this prevents a lookalike soroban_sdk module in an unrelated crate from being flagged, and avoids silent breakage if SDK paths change between versions.\r\nKept the existing mock-based UI tests in soroban_cost_lints/ui/main.rs unchanged for fast feedback; this fixture complements rather than replaces them (relates to #9 — no duplication of that reorg).\r\n\r\nTesting:\r\n\r\ncargo fmt --all -- --check ✅\r\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings ✅\r\ncargo test --workspace ✅ (existing mock UI tests + new real-SDK fixture both pass)\r\nCI builds the fixture crate against the pinned toolchain.Closes #15\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an integration test that runs the lints end-to-end against the real soroban-sdk crate, and hardens the type-path resolution so it's no longer based on string-suffix matching.\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n\r\nAdded [fixture path, e.g. soroban_cost_lints/tests/fixtures/] — a minimal real Soroban contract crate depending on actual soroban-sdk, containing one example of each lint's anti-pattern plus its clean counterpart.\r\nWired the fixture into cargo test --workspace via dylint's ui_test support, with its own Cargo.toml excluded from the main workspace to avoid lockfile/version conflicts.\r\nReplaced def_path_str-based suffix comparison in soroban_cost_lints/src/lib.rs with clippy_utils::match_def_path, matching on the DefId's actual crate identity plus exact path segments — this prevents a lookalike soroban_sdk module in an unrelated crate from being flagged, and avoids silent breakage if SDK paths change between versions.\r\nKept the existing mock-based UI tests in soroban_cost_lints/ui/main.rs unchanged for fast feedback; this fixture complements rather than replaces them (relates to #9 — no duplication of that reorg).\r\n\r\nTesting:\r\n\r\ncargo fmt --all -- --check ✅\r\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings ✅\r\ncargo test --workspace ✅ (existing mock UI tests + new real-SDK fixture both pass)\r\nCI builds the fixture crate against the pinned toolchain.",
